      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**原始告警**来自实际规则，**持续提醒**关联原始告警，不表示新增独立故障。中文说明取自规则原文，是排查建议，不是自动确认的根因。\n\n用列标题筛选状态、级别和对象；**问题摘要 → 实例详情**，**查看证据 → 按对象过滤的基础设施面板**。空表表示当前无非 Watchdog 实例；若左上角有错误标记则是数据请求失败。"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Alertmanager 每 5 分钟刷新是预期行为；bridge 根据状态和退避决定发布。两类请求分组口径不同，不能直接计算端到端送达率；bridge 曲线排除 test。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(alertmanager_notifications_total{integration=\"webhook\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "AM webhook 尝试",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(alert_bridge_notifications_total{result=\"sent\",notification_class!=\"test\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "bridge 已发布",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(alert_bridge_notifications_total{result=\"suppressed\",notification_class!=\"test\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "bridge 已抑制",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "上游刷新与桥发布速率",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
